k in both schedules.\n- Only claim a check was performed if it was actually performed.\n- List assumptions and limitations, such as missing or stale forecasts.\n\nHow to answer:\n- You have exactly one response. There are no tools, no schedule checker and no second attempt.\n- Return one JSON object that matches the supplied schema, containing both the schedule and its explanation.\n- No schedule checks are performed before you answer, so do not claim that any were.\n- You may start, defer or abstain for any visible job. Give a reason and evidence IDs for each deferral or abstention."
